Z||000000||2M4 Dale||06-27-2000||09:43 AM||||I'm planning a cookout along with a trip to Norwalk Dragstrip on the weekend of August 12-13. I'll provide camping to anyone interested and there are several hotels/motels in the area as well. So all of you Ohio and vincinety Fiero owners are invited. Just kinda try to let me know. I'm located right between Ashland and Mansfield. There are many things going on that particular weekend round here. Including 1.Ames Pontiac Performance Nationals at Norwalk. 2. Cart FedEx at Mid-Ohio. 3. Mansfield Motorsports circle track/stock car raceing. 4. Dragway 42 dragstrip. 5. SCCA AutoXing in Mansfield.<P>Plus there is plenty of shopping , antiques, etc.||||reg||6
