Z||000016||2M4 Dale||06-29-2000||12:43 PM||||OK , Scott you're on ! (glad I don't have to sleep in the tent with you)<P>For those of you who would prefer to get a room as opposed to camping out. Here is some info for you. First off I would like to remind you that there are a quite a few things going on in the area that weekend. So , please, call and make reservations as soon as possible.<P>GOOD:    Super 8 Motel - Ashland<BR>         1-800-800-8000<P>BETTER:  Amerihost Inn<BR>         1-800-434-5800<BR>         <A HREF="http://www.amerihostinn.com" TARGET=_blank>www.amerihostinn.com</A> <P>BEST:    Holiday Inn Express / hotel & suites<BR>         1-877-281-STAY<BR>         email:asxoh@hotmail.com<BR>         (This Hotel is brand new)<P>||||reg||1
