Z||000037||87ECO5||08-06-2000||09:48 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/map_to_dales_2.jpg"> <P>Here are three maps (sorry for the large size).  The first is intended to be used for reference only.  By displaying a wide area, the first map makes it easier to determine where the location of the cookout is in relation to your starting point.<P>The second and third maps show more detail.  The third map probably could have been omitted except that it shows how Vantilburg is intersected by another road (several feet worth of another road).  I never would have figured this out the first time I went to Dale's had I not been following him up the street.<P>By looking at the second map, I'd say the best route (and Dale can correct me on this) is to follow I-71 towards Ashland then go West on 250 through Ashland to Olivesburg.  There, you'll go South on 545 for a mile or two then East on Vantilburg (watching for Fieros, of course!).       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Hope these help ...<p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 08-06-2000).]||||reg||1
